the-firm-as-one-program-77 : List Word
the-firm-as-one-program-77 = unlines (cons "- **S1** The gains multiply instead of adding, which changes the rate of learning of a firm built as one program (all of the outline's “Value to the firm”)." (cons "  The lines of value to the firm do not add; they multiply. Faster iteration means more strategies tested, cumulative knowledge means each test builds on all earlier ones, proven risk means more capital behind each, and exact reasoning under uncertainty means better decisions per unit of capital. Artificial researchers multiply all of it again. The result is a firm whose rate of learning is itself rising. Its advantage over competitors is a difference in kind, not a margin." nil))
